<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T(About this program: This course provides a comprehensive introduction to API Testing, equipping learners with the skills to ensure the reliability, functionality, and performance of Application Programming Interfaces \(APIs\). The course covers both manual and automated testing techniques and emphasizes best practices for validating RESTful API\220s. Participants will explore key concepts such as HTTP methods, status codes, request/response structures, authentication, and API documentation. Hands-on exercises using popular tools like Postman and Burpsuite.)/E(About this program: This course provides a comprehensive introduction to API Testing, equipping learners with the skills to ensure the reliability, functionality, and performance of Application Programming Interfaces \(APIs\). The course covers both manual and automated testing techniques and emphasizes best practices for validating RESTful API\220s. Participants will explore key concepts such as HTTP methods, status codes, request/response structures, authentication, and API documentation. Hands-on exercises using popular tools like Postman and Burpsuite.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[6]>>
